  "description": "C# port of Philter-Lite — a rule-based PHI de-identification engine for\n      clinical free text. Targets HIPAA Safe Harbor-style redaction, intended\n      to scrub clinical notes before transmission to third-party LLM APIs.\n      Original Python implementation by UCSF Pediatrics (BSD-3); this .NET\n      port adds a sidecar mechanism, pluggable POS tagger, and an\n      IPhiDeidentificationService abstraction.",
